[
  {
    "displayName": "Cloud Run Job: execucao FALHOU (qualquer job do projeto)",
    "combiner": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "conditionThreshold": {
          "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/job/completed_execution_count\" AND metric.labels.result=\"failed\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_job\"",
          "comparison": "COMPARISON_GT",
          "duration": "0s",
          "trigger": {
            "count": 1
          },
          "aggregations": [
            {
              "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
              "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
              "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
              "groupByFields": [
                "resource.label.job_name"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "displayName": "completed_execution_count result=failed > 0"
      }
    ],
    "notificationChannels": [
      "{CHANNEL}"
    ],
    "enabled": true
  },
  {
    "displayName": "Google Ads: conta sem grant apos resync",
    "documentation": {
      "content": "Uma ou mais contas Google Ads ativas no inventario nao tem NENHUM gestor com grant vivo (fila sem_delegacao). Delegue em /admin/access (ou manager_account_access.grant) assim que possivel -- e o mesmo buraco que deixou a Hust App dias sem ninguem responsavel. Ver docs/operacao/infra-setup.md, secao Runbook: alerta de conta Google sem grant.",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown"
    },
    "combiner": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "conditionThreshold": {
          "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/google_accounts_sem_grant_total\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_job\"",
          "comparison": "COMPARISON_GT",
          "duration": "0s",
          "trigger": {
            "count": 1
          },
          "aggregations": [
            {
              "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
              "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_PERCENTILE_99"
            }
          ]
        },
        "displayName": "google_accounts_sem_grant_total > 0"
      }
    ],
    "notificationChannels": [
      "{CHANNEL}"
    ],
    "enabled": true,
    "alertStrategy": {
      "autoClose": "86400s"
    }
  },
  {
    "displayName": "Logs: severity>=ERROR no servico v4-ads-mcp",
    "combiner": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "displayName": "ERROR em cloud_run_revision/v4-ads-mcp",
        "conditionMatchedLog": {
          "filter": "resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\" AND resource.labels.service_name=\"v4-ads-mcp\" AND severity>=ERROR"
        }
      }
    ],
    "notificationChannels": [
      "{CHANNEL}"
    ],
    "enabled": true,
    "alertStrategy": {
      "notificationRateLimit": {
        "period": "3600s"
      },
      "autoClose": "86400s"
    }
  },
  {
    "displayName": "Meta Ads: quota acima de 75% ou BUC nao lido",
    "documentation": {
      "content": "O limitador Meta do servico avisou. meta_rate_limit_warning: algum sinal de quota medido passou de 75% (o log diz qual em acima_de_75) -- o token do system user e COMPARTILHADO por todas as contas, entao a proxima chamada pode ser limitada. meta_buc_nao_lido: o cabecalho X-Business-Use-Case-Usage veio ausente ou ilegivel (formato mudou?). Ver docs/operacao/infra-setup.md e o F194 no findings-catalog.",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown"
    },
    "combiner": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "conditionThreshold": {
          "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/meta_avisos_de_quota\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\"",
          "comparison": "COMPARISON_GT",
          "duration": "0s",
          "trigger": {
            "count": 1
          },
          "aggregations": [
            {
              "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
              "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
              "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
              "groupByFields": [
                "metric.label.evento"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "displayName": "meta_avisos_de_quota > 0"
      }
    ],
    "notificationChannels": [
      "{CHANNEL}"
    ],
    "enabled": true,
    "alertStrategy": {
      "autoClose": "86400s"
    }
  },
  {
    "displayName": "Uptime: v4-ads-mcp /health?deep=1 falhou",
    "combiner": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "conditionThreshold": {
          "filter": "metric.type=\"monitoring.googleapis.com/uptime_check/check_passed\" AND metric.labels.check_id=\"{CHECK_ID}\" AND resource.type=\"uptime_url\"",
          "comparison": "COMPARISON_GT",
          "thresholdValue": 1,
          "duration": "300s",
          "trigger": {
            "count": 1
          },
          "aggregations": [
            {
              "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
              "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_NEXT_OLDER",
              "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_COUNT_FALSE",
              "groupByFields": [
                "resource.label.host"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "displayName": "check_passed false"
      }
    ],
    "notificationChannels": [
      "{CHANNEL}"
    ],
    "enabled": true
  }
]
